+    "F(t)=t*w+sum h_j(t)u_j after sampling a normal a, with a*w=1 and all "
+    "a*u_j=0.  Thus a*F(t)=t and ker(a) is a perfect code without search.  "
+    "The product of two such codes is a perfect code in the strong product, "
