The named `hard` rung (\(p=47\)) has also been solved on its first attempt. The answer length stayed fixed as required, but increasing only the modulus is not hiding the shared-nullspace signature from the oracle. I’m allowing the script’s final prescribed rounds to complete; I will not tune a new construction after seeing these results.
